{"id":"n38486-1-8","stage":5,"title":"기하다 · 从……起","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38486-1-8-1","ko":"이웃 나라와 국경 지대에서 접전이 일어났었다며?","zh":"听说在边境地区和邻国交上了火？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이웃","meaning":"邻，比邻","explanation":"이웃：邻，比邻。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"1","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}},{"text":"나라와","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라와","audio":"/audio/de72b2ce657ad131f6d1.mp3"}},{"text":"국경","meaning":"国境，边境","explanation":"국경：国境，边境。","readings":[{"term":"국경","audio":"/audio/019addc731638169bb92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36787","senseId":"1","lemma":"국경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국경","audio":"/audio/019addc731638169bb92.mp3"}},{"text":"지대에서","meaning":"地带，地区","explanation":"지대：地带，地区；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"지대","audio":"/audio/283430b584906e735dcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27784","senseId":"1","lemma":"지대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지대에서","audio":"/audio/d17463025a92248b3b7a.mp3"}},{"text":"접전이","meaning":"交战，交火","explanation":"접전：交战，交火；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"접전","audio":"/audio/b7865f84a337d13c63ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77471","senseId":"1","lemma":"접전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"접전이","audio":"/audio/54739d3f70f5ad0715f0.mp3"}},{"text":"일어났었다며?","meaning":"发生，起","explanation":"일어나다：发生，起；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"7